    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## CommunityConnect: email\n\nSends announcements to members set to EMAIL or \"also email\", and reply / voicemail / signup alerts.\n\nEmails go out through the **Gmail API** (not SMTP: the n8n server's hosting blocks the SMTP mail ports, which is why the old step timed out).\n\n1. Open **Send Email (Gmail)** → Credential → **Create new** → **Gmail OAuth2** → **Sign in with Google** as **hello@nivolink.com**. Name it `hello@nivolink.com (Gmail)`.\n2. Save, then **Publish**.\n\nThe first step checks the **CommunityConnect dispatch secret** credential. No passwords are typed in this workflow.",
        "height": 380,
        "width": 460,
        "color": 5
      },
      "id": "740db2b7-e314-451c-b71d-c59d44e83c8c",
      "name": "Read Me",
